{"files": [{"id": 40118770, "name": "combined_dataset.csv", "size": 276727, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/40118770", "supplied_md5": "2f13d7a4cdd9229e4dda21a7040fc328", "computed_md5": "2f13d7a4cdd9229e4dda21a7040fc328", "mimetype": "text/plain"}, {"id": 40118830, "name": "Yahya et al. (2012).csv", "size": 47087, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/40118830", "supplied_md5": "10b257b503aba7bc7a463c208b761ab2", "computed_md5": "10b257b503aba7bc7a463c208b761ab2", "mimetype": "text/plain"}, {"id": 40299562, "name": "collected_dataset.csv", "size": 151908, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/40299562", "supplied_md5": "64d2bd8082c174c4bfadc5632002f034", "computed_md5": "64d2bd8082c174c4bfadc5632002f034", "mimetype": "text/plain"}, {"id": 40299565, "name": "Mohammed and Omar (2020).csv", "size": 9137, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/40299565", "supplied_md5": "4069d256157282c634d96dc827341cef", "computed_md5": "4069d256157282c634d96dc827341cef", "mimetype": "text/plain"}, {"id": 40299568, "name": "Sangodiah et al. (2017)-1.csv", "size": 47314, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/40299568", "supplied_md5": "be885c5832d180f32d8b9105e4da50a5", "computed_md5": "be885c5832d180f32d8b9105e4da50a5", "mimetype": "text/plain"}, {"id": 40299571, "name": "Sangodiah et al. (2017)-2.csv", "size": 20571, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/40299571", "supplied_md5": "4f395681021f94a8a4f1deacc3c581df", "computed_md5": "4f395681021f94a8a4f1deacc3c581df", "mimetype": "text/plain"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 15215653, "full_name": "Mohammed Osman Gani", "first_name": "Mohammed Osman", "last_name": "Gani", "is_active": true, "url_name": "Mohammed_Osman_Gani", "orcid_id": "0000-0002-9918-8589"}, {"id": 15358763, "full_name": "Anbuselvan Sangodiah", "first_name": "Anbuselvan", "last_name": "Sangodiah", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": "0000-0002-3277-4006"}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://figshare.com/articles/dataset/Exam_Question_Datasets/22597957", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p>The datasets contain<strong> exam questions</strong> labelled based on Bloom's Taxonomy Cognitive domain.</p>\n<p>We collected the <strong>\"collected_dataset.csv\"</strong> and labelled it. Four datasets were collected from the following articles:\u00a0</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>1. Yahya, A. A., Toukal, Z., & Osman, A. (2012). Bloom's Taxonomy\u2013Based Classification for Item Bank Questions Using Support Vector Machines. In Modern Advances in Intelligent Systems and Tools (Vol. 431, pp. 135\u2013140).</p>\n<p>2. \u00a0Sangodiah A., Ahmad, R., & Ahmad, W. F. W. (2017). Taxonomy based features in question classification using support vector machine. Journal of Theoretical and Applied Information Technology, 95(12), 2814\u20132823.\u00a0</p>\n<p>3. Mohammed, M., & Omar, N. (2020). Question classification based on Bloom\u2019s taxonomy cognitive domain using modified TF-IDF and word2vec. PLoS ONE, 15(3), 1\u201321. https://doi.org/10.1371/ journal.pone.0230442</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>And finally, the <strong>\"combined dataset.csv\"</strong> contains all questions of these five datasets.</p>\n<p><br></p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 3, "status": "public", "size": 552744, "created_date": "2023-04-26T12:13:19Z", "modified_date": "2023-04-26T12:13:19Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["Bloom's taxonomy", "Exam questions"], "keywords": ["Bloom's taxonomy", "Exam questions"], "categories": [{"id": 26074, "title": "Curriculum and pedagogy theory and development", "parent_id": 26068, "path": "/26065/26068/26074", "source_id": "390102", "taxonomy_id": 100}], "references": [], "has_linked_file": false, "citation": "Gani, Mohammed Osman; Sangodiah, Anbuselvan (2023). Exam Question Datasets. figshare. Dataset. https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.22597957.v3", "related_materials": [], "is_embargoed": false, "embargo_date": null, "embargo_type": null, "embargo_title": "", "embargo_reason": "", "embargo_options": [], "id": 22597957, "title": "Exam Question Datasets", "doi": "10.6084/m9.figshare.22597957.v3", "handle": "", "url": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/articles/22597957", "published_date": "2023-04-26T12:13:19Z", "thumb": "", "defined_type": 3, "defined_type_name": "dataset", "group_id": null, "url_private_api": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/account/articles/22597957", "url_public_api": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/articles/22597957", "url_private_html": "https://figshare.com/account/articles/22597957", "url_public_html": "https://figshare.com/articles/dataset/Exam_Question_Datasets/22597957", "timeline": {"posted": "2023-04-26T12:13:19", "firstOnline": "2023-04-26T11:32:56"}, "resource_title": null, "resource_doi": null}